Image design rule source
------------------------

The browser-side image design registries, recommendation rules, workflow
ideas, and prompt compilation guidance include adaptations of:

  Baoyu Skills
  https://github.com/JimLiu/baoyu-skills
  Reference commit: 6b7a2e417500561a5ecdd0b168332f4142584617

Those adapted portions are used under the MIT License. They were translated
into local TypeScript data and browser workflows; the original Agent runtime,
scripts, and file-system mechanisms are not included.

